menuconfig ZMK_HELIX_PROFILE_RGB
    bool "Helix Bluetooth profile RGB indicator"
    default y
    depends on ZMK_BLE
    depends on ZMK_RGB_UNDERGLOW
    help
      Set a distinct underglow color for each active Bluetooth profile.
      Connected profiles are solid; disconnected, unpaired, or advertising
      profiles use ZMK's slow breathe effect. On a split keyboard the central
      invokes the global RGB behavior so both halves remain synchronized.
